{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13203390","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13203390","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:4:1320339001:1":{"text":"아저씨... 이 그림은 레프스키의 마지막 작품인 「미완성」이에요. 복원을 마쳤으니 받아주세요.","source_cn":"大叔……这幅画是列夫斯基最后的作品，名叫《未完成》。我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8255D9D6CF7A0F04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320339002:1":{"text":"이, 이걸 받을 수는 없어요! 돈을 들여서 산 물건일 텐데, 저에게 주시다니요!","source_cn":"这……这怎么能行呢！你们花钱买下它，怎么能送给我？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3C5EC330765613A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320339003:1":{"text":"어서, 어서 가져가세요!","source_cn":"快快快，快收回去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F29D65F77DCBDB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1320339003":{"text":"어서, 어서 가져가세요!","source_cn":"快快快，快收回去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F29D65F77DCBDB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320339005:1":{"text":"레프스키... 휴, 불쌍한 내 아들... 흑...","source_cn":"列夫斯基……唉，我可怜的儿子……呜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4B1BFAEC417EACB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320339006:3":{"text":"예브게니 영감, 문 열어!","source_cn":"老叶甫根尼——开门！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD637AC69D8EBCC1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320339007:1":{"text":"열까지 센다. 안 열면 부수고 들어갈 거야!","source_cn":"我数到十，不开门的话我就踹了——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC9E1A83326E0C47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320339008:1":{"text":"밖에 누구죠? 하필 지금 찾아와 소란을 피우다니!","source_cn":"门外是谁啊？好讨厌，都这种时候了还过来找茬！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70DD41FC881F12C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320339009:1":{"text":"마스터, 나가서 상황을 살펴봐요. 정말로 문을 부수고 들어오면 큰일이잖아요!","source_cn":"梅林，我们出去看看吧。要是他们真的踹门闯进来就不好了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3A8B7B6F891C0147","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터, 나가서 상황을 살펴봐요. 정말로 문을 부수고 들어오면 큰일이잖아요!","female":"마스터, 나가서 상황을 살펴봐요. 정말로 문을 부수고 들어오면 큰일이잖아요!","variant_male_record_index":"144471","variant_female_record_index":"144472","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"이건 레프스키의 마지막 소원이었어","source_cn":"这是列夫斯基的临终心愿","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x45F96A7BA2916896","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이건 레프스키의 마지막 소원이었어","female":"이건 레프스키의 마지막 소원이었어","variant_male_record_index":"68488","variant_female_record_index":"684